  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "BlitzCache v2.1.0 - Capacity-Based Size Limit (Optional)\n\nNEW IN v2.1.0:\n• Approximate memory usage tracking (Statistics.ApproximateMemoryBytes)\n• TopHeaviestEntries to identify largest cached items\n• Logging includes Approx. Memory and Top Heaviest sections\n• Optional maxCacheSizeBytes to enable capacity-based eviction using MemoryCache.SizeLimit\n• Automatic per-entry sizing via lightweight IValueSizer so the limit is enforced\n• Works even when statistics are disabled\n• DI: AddBlitzCache now accepts maxCacheSizeBytes\n• New tests ensuring eviction occurs and memory stays within the limit\n\nNotes:\n• Sizing is best-effort and designed to be lightweight for common types.\n• Capacity-based eviction relies on Microsoft.Extensions.Caching.Memory heuristics.",
